          "author_email": "530235+brandon-fryslie@users.noreply.github.com",
          "timestamp": "2026-11-18T10:33:34-07:00",
          "message": "fix(storage): a plugin storage folder's fault clears when the OS or the disk answers again (oiyf)\n\nA refused or erroring watch, a failed stat, or a folder that cannot be\nmade each stands only while that answer does: the registry's period\nreopens the watch, every judgment stats again, and every hold, period\nand catch-up makes the folder again. A folder that cannot be made holds\nno watch. Each fault source is logged and counted on its own moves, and\na generation that closes logs the faults it ended with.\n"
        }
      ]
    },
